file construction/archive/REDS-a-guard-that-named-a-fault-nobody-could-act-on-rows-536.md the shelf and its header, written by hand as the fold tool requires
file tools/fixtures/r/reds_spine_derive_scan.sh first_commit and arrival_advice seated, the stamp lookup excludes the disputed number, the pathspec derives from the spine's own files, MAX_ADVICE bounds the expensive reading while the gate stays unbounded
file tools/fixtures/r/reds_spine_derive_control.sh four cases added -- the published duplicate, its repair, the asymmetric seat, and the bound proven by planting nine
file tools/r/reds_spine_derive_witness.rish the case count moved seventeen to thirty-one in the GREEN line, same commit as the behavior
